-- title:
--   An affine mass bound from the three-dimensional cap estimate
-- statement:
--   Let $0.156\le r\le\frac23$ and $P\le\frac12$ with $r\le\frac83P(1-P)$. Then
--   $$
--   \frac{108}{125}\,r^2+\frac{143}{5000}\le P .
--   $$
--
--   For four cells, the cap estimate on each normalized centroid converts into this lower bound on the cell's mass.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/openai/math/blob/1581d4cbdd69a0faf34b2089614fe2a814316a6a/lean/OAI/Probability/GaussianPropeller/CapCertificates.lean#L90-L105

